WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.861
Gitara tori ikki uchidan mahkamlangan,

2
00:00:02.861 --> 00:00:09.262
shuning uchun to‘lqinlar qaytadi va Dalamber formulasi to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri ishlamaydi.

3
00:00:09.262 --> 00:00:16.114
Furye usuli boshqa yo‘l taklif qiladi: yechimni oddiy “modalar” yig‘indisi sifatida qurish.

4
00:00:16.114 --> 00:00:20.030
Bu qismda tor va sterjen uchun bu usulni o‘rganamiz.

5
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:25.534
Yechimni katta X x karra katta T t ko‘rinishida izlaymiz.

6
00:00:25.534 --> 00:00:27.286
Tenglamaga qo‘ysak,

7
00:00:27.286 --> 00:00:38.164
x ga bog‘liq qism t ga bog‘liq qismga teng bo‘ladi; bu faqat ikkalasi bir xil o‘zgarmas minus lambda bo‘lganda mumkin.

8
00:00:38.164 --> 00:00:45.446
X uchun masala: X ikki shtrix qo‘shuv lambda X teng nol, X nolda va X l da nol.

9
00:00:45.696 --> 00:00:51.763
Lambda manfiy yoki nol bo‘lsa, faqat nol yechim chiqadi.

10
00:00:51.763 --> 00:01:01.948
Lambda musbat bo‘lsa, X teng sinus ildiz lambda x, va sinus ildiz lambda l nol bo‘lishi kerak.

11
00:01:01.948 --> 00:01:13.649
Demak, xos qiymatlar lambda n teng n pi bo‘lingan l ning kvadrati, xos funksiyalar sinus n pi x bo‘lingan l,

12
00:01:13.649 --> 00:01:16.574
n bir, ikki, uch va hokazo.

13
00:01:16.824 --> 00:01:22.722
Misol: u t t teng u x x, x noldan pi gacha, uchlari mahkamlangan.

14
00:01:22.722 --> 00:01:30.978
Boshlang‘ich shakl ikki sinus x ayiruv sinus uch x, boshlang‘ich tezlik to‘rt sinus ikki x.

15
00:01:30.978 --> 00:01:36.422
Bu yerda modalar sinus n x karra kosinus n t yoki sinus n t.

16
00:01:36.672 --> 00:01:43.255
Berilganlar allaqachon sinuslar yig‘indisi, shuning uchun integral kerak emas.

17
00:01:43.255 --> 00:01:48.403
t nolda solishtiramiz: A bir teng ikki, A uch teng minus bir.

18
00:01:48.403 --> 00:01:54.310
Tezlikda n karra B n turadi: ikki B ikki teng to‘rt, B ikki teng ikki.

19
00:01:54.310 --> 00:02:02.918
Javob: ikki sinus x kosinus t qo‘shuv ikki sinus ikki x sinus ikki t ayiruv sinus uch x kosinus uch t.

20
00:02:03.168 --> 00:02:07.935
Sterjendagi issiqlik uchun X bo‘yicha masala aynan shunday,

21
00:02:07.935 --> 00:02:14.561
lekin T endi birinchi tartibli tenglamani qanoatlantiradi va eksponensial so‘nadi.

22
00:02:14.561 --> 00:02:21.106
Masalan, boshlang‘ich harorat besh sinus pi x qo‘shuv ikki sinus uch pi x bo‘lsa,

23
00:02:21.106 --> 00:02:30.398
yechim besh e daraja minus pi kvadrat t sinus pi x qo‘shuv ikki e daraja minus to‘qqiz pi kvadrat t sinus uch pi x.

24
00:02:30.648 --> 00:02:38.515
Grafikda harorat profili uch paytda: t teng nol, nol butun yuzdan bir va nol butun yuzdan besh.

25
00:02:38.515 --> 00:02:42.076
Uchinchi moda to‘qqiz marta tezroq so‘nadi,

26
00:02:42.076 --> 00:02:48.535
shuning uchun profil tezda oddiy bitta yoyga aylanadi va keyin sekin pasayadi.

27
00:02:48.535 --> 00:02:52.262
Torda esa modalar so‘nmaydi, balki tebranadi.

28
00:02:52.512 --> 00:03:00.249
Savol: uzunligi l bo‘lgan sterjenda, uchlarida nol harorat, n-moda vaqt bo‘yicha qanday o‘zgaradi?

29
00:03:00.249 --> 00:03:04.118
Daraja ko‘rsatkichidagi kvadratga e’tibor bering.
